+# Audit: the baby avatar (0.12.0), from Cochilo 0.13.0
+
+Method: design review only (detector not applicable, native platform): impeccable critique
+(Android guidance, craft floor) and graphic-design-fundamentals §13, on `onboarding_meet_light`,
+`onboarding_look_ptBR_dark`, `avatar_matrix_light`, `empty_today_light`, `settings_light`,
+`fabric_picker_ptBR_light`.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals §13
+
+| # | Check | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | The baby looks like hers; first run warm and short. ✅ |
+| 2 | Concept | The baby in a Rosa Chá sling: the brand's subject. ✅ |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Title, avatar, one line, fields, one teal action. ✅ |
+| 4 | Contrast | Eyes on skin 6 were weak; fixed with a darker line and catchlights. ✅ after fix |
+| 5 | Alignment | One left axis on both steps; avatar centred only in the picker and the Today card, where it is the subject. ✅ |
+| 6 | Spacing | Spacing tokens only; picker groups separated by captions. ✅ |
+| 7 | Typography | Existing roles. ✅ |
+| 8 | Colour | Illustration palette apart from UI and data colours; teal only on Next/Done. ✅ |
+| 9 | Consistency | Picker uses the system's swatch ring and filter chips. ✅ |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Hair colour hidden for "none yet"; look step skippable. ✅ |
+| 11 | Real size | Avatar read at 44dp (Settings) and 112dp. ✅ |
+| 12 | Accessibility | Swatches are radio buttons with spoken names ("Skin tone 3 of 6"); avatar described ("Drawing of Dante"). ✅ |
+| 13 | Production | Vector, no assets; Room migration and backup version 3. ✅ |
+
+## impeccable critique
+
+| # | Heuristic | Score | Note |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | System status | 4 | Live preview of every choice. |
+| 2 | Real world | 4 | "How Dante looks", skin tone not race, "rather not say". |
+| 3 | Control | 4 | Skip for now; changeable in Settings. |
+| 4 | Consistency | 4 | Same picker in onboarding and Settings. |
+| 5 | Error prevention | 3 | Next disabled until a name; dates picked, never typed. |
+| 6 | Recognition | 4 | Swatches and words side by side. |
+| 7 | Efficiency | 3 | One more screen than before, skippable. |
+| 8 | Aesthetic | 4 | Soft, warm, brand-specific. |
+| 9 | Error recovery | 3 | Everything editable later. |
+| 10 | Help | 3 | One line per step explains why. |
+| | **Total** | **36/40** | |
+
+Issues found and fixed in this release: weak eyes on deep skin tones; "Appearance" used twice in
+Settings (the baby row is now "How Bebê looks"); dates in English on Portuguese screens.
